{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6412c7d7-cbe5-82f0-9a11-f60cfd511e30",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T14:44:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Omar Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:41:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Um, yeah. [pause] I'm trying to figure out something about a fence. I think I'm calling the right place, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:41:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are, fences come through us. What are you looking to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:41:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I've got a dog, and he keeps slipping out of the yard. Gets through the gate if you open it even a little. So I want a fence around the back. Something to keep him in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:41:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know what kind of fence you're picturing? Material, height, that sort of thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:41:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "White picket style. Four feet tall. [sighs] I think four is standard, but I honestly don't know what's standard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:41:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four feet is a pretty common height for a picket fence, yes. Is it the back yard only, or would any of it run along the front or the side facing the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Uh, back and maybe a little down one side. Not the front. Wait, is the side the part by the street? I have a corner, sort of. No, it's not a corner. The side is next to the neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:42:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the back and one side along the neighbor. That's helpful to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:42:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So, the main thing is, do I need a permit for this? Does a fence need a permit, or is that only for bigger stuff?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:42:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In general, yes, a fence usually does need a permit here, even a lower one. Where it goes and how tall it is can change the details, but I'd plan on applying before you build anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:42:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay. I thought maybe under a certain height you didn't. I think my cousin said that. Maybe that was somewhere else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:42:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could have been another town. They all handle it a little differently."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:42:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. [sighs] Okay. And then, do I need a survey? Like of the property? I have something from when I bought the place, but I don't know if that counts. Is that a survey or is that the, the plot thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:43:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Do you remember what the document looks like? Is it a drawing of the lot with measurements and the house marked on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:43:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, kind of. There's a drawing, with the house in a rectangle. And numbers on the sides. But it's folded up and has coffee on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:43:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That may be what they call a plot plan or survey. The permit staff would be the ones to say if it's good enough to show the property lines. I'd bring it in or send a picture and they can tell you whether you need anything newer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:43:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I don't know yet if I need a new one. Just that maybe not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:43:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's the honest answer. It depends on what you have and how close to the line you're building. Do you want me to have someone from the permit desk call you back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:43:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd be good. My number is 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:44:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0194. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:44:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Omar Haddad. H-A-D-D-A-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:44:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Haddad. I'll note that it's about a four-foot picket fence, back and one side, and a question on the survey."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:44:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's it. Sorry, I'm a little scattered. It's been a long day. [pause] I did get new slippers this morning, though. Really nice ones. Very pleased with them. That's been the highlight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:44:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's something. Good slippers help. Someone should call you back soon, probably within a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:44:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So permit, yes, and survey, maybe. I'll dig out the paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:44:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:44:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. You too."
    }
  ],
